1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:05,347
Every company you have ever heard of… started the same way.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:10,379
Someone stood up in front of a room, and asked them to believe.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,750
This is ACE Pitch Day.

4
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:21,132
You built something. Now you have three minutes, to make the whole room believe in it.

5
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,432
Psst! Wanna know the rules?

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,270
Everyone gets a sealed envelope of cash. How much is inside? Only you know.

7
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:33,850
Listen to every pitch. Then put your money, where you believe.

8
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,350
Just one rule. You can't invest in yourself.

9
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,437
Nope. Not even a little!

10
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:44,558
The founder who raises the most, wins one month of Claude Team Premium.

11
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,550
October fifteenth. Bring your best pitch.

12
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,931
See you there!
